        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Droppy Ball</strong>, a game where you drop colorful balls into a box, aiming to combine the balls for massive scores! It's all about deliberate thinking and a bit of physics as you watch your creations cascade and combine.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How You Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868500/extras/ae1949a21b89f0462fd64f8edbfb692a.poster.avif?t=1763999626\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868500/extras/ae1949a21b89f0462fd64f8edbfb692a.webm?t=1763999626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868500/extras/ae1949a21b89f0462fd64f8edbfb692a.mp4?t=1763999626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main goal in Droppy Ball is simple: drop balls into a box. But there's a trick! When two balls of the same color touch, they combine into a larger ball of the next color. Think of it like a chain reaction, starting with pink, then moving through a rainbow of colors. The bigger the ball you create, the more points you earn.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explosions, Combos, and High Stakes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868500/extras/bc885cfd5bb3de5e83251acc68a58632.poster.avif?t=1763999626\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868500/extras/bc885cfd5bb3de5e83251acc68a58632.webm?t=1763999626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868500/extras/bc885cfd5bb3de5e83251acc68a58632.mp4?t=1763999626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time balls combine, they let out a small <strong>explosion</strong> that pushes other balls around. This adds an exciting, unpredictable element to each drop. Sometimes it helps you clear a path, and sometimes it throws balls where you don't want them or ends your run. If you can manage to get multiple balls to combine from a single drop, you'll create a <strong>combo streak</strong>, making your score skyrocket! But be careful – the box has limited space. If any balls spill out, it's game over!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Void Ball</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868500/extras/2f2ab99c34e703018a83082ee29cd767.poster.avif?t=1763999626\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868500/extras/2f2ab99c34e703018a83082ee29cd767.webm?t=1763999626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868500/extras/2f2ab99c34e703018a83082ee29cd767.mp4?t=1763999626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye out for the <strong>Void Ball</strong>! It's the last ball in the sequence. When two Void Balls combine, they vanish completely from the box. This clears space and keeps the game going, especially when things start to get crowded. Mastering the Void Ball is key to chasing those high scores.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chase the High Score</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868500/extras/121839be004e24478252c36b11e7a5e2.poster.avif?t=1763999626\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868500/extras/121839be004e24478252c36b11e7a5e2.webm?t=1763999626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868500/extras/121839be004e24478252c36b11e7a5e2.mp4?t=1763999626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Droppy Ball is all about pushing your limits and getting the highest score possible. Each game offers new opportunities to refine your dropping strategy, anticipate reactions, and pull off incredible combos. Can you outsmart the physics and become the ultimate Droppy Ball master?</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Droppy Ball</strong>, a game where you drop colorful balls into a box, aiming to combine the balls for massive scores! It's all about deliberate thinking and a bit of physics as you watch your creations cascade and combine.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How You Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868500/extras/ae1949a21b89f0462fd64f8edbfb692a.poster.avif?t=1763999626\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868500/extras/ae1949a21b89f0462fd64f8edbfb692a.webm?t=1763999626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868500/extras/ae1949a21b89f0462fd64f8edbfb692a.mp4?t=1763999626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main goal in Droppy Ball is simple: drop balls into a box. But there's a trick! When two balls of the same color touch, they combine into a larger ball of the next color. Think of it like a chain reaction, starting with pink, then moving through a rainbow of colors. The bigger the ball you create, the more points you earn.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explosions, Combos, and High Stakes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868500/extras/bc885cfd5bb3de5e83251acc68a58632.poster.avif?t=1763999626\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868500/extras/bc885cfd5bb3de5e83251acc68a58632.webm?t=1763999626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868500/extras/bc885cfd5bb3de5e83251acc68a58632.mp4?t=1763999626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time balls combine, they let out a small <strong>explosion</strong> that pushes other balls around. This adds an exciting, unpredictable element to each drop. Sometimes it helps you clear a path, and sometimes it throws balls where you don't want them or ends your run. If you can manage to get multiple balls to combine from a single drop, you'll create a <strong>combo streak</strong>, making your score skyrocket! But be careful – the box has limited space. If any balls spill out, it's game over!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Void Ball</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868500/extras/2f2ab99c34e703018a83082ee29cd767.poster.avif?t=1763999626\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868500/extras/2f2ab99c34e703018a83082ee29cd767.webm?t=1763999626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868500/extras/2f2ab99c34e703018a83082ee29cd767.mp4?t=1763999626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye out for the <strong>Void Ball</strong>! It's the last ball in the sequence. When two Void Balls combine, they vanish completely from the box. This clears space and keeps the game going, especially when things start to get crowded. Mastering the Void Ball is key to chasing those high scores.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chase the High Score</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868500/extras/121839be004e24478252c36b11e7a5e2.poster.avif?t=1763999626\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868500/extras/121839be004e24478252c36b11e7a5e2.webm?t=1763999626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868500/extras/121839be004e24478252c36b11e7a5e2.mp4?t=1763999626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Droppy Ball is all about pushing your limits and getting the highest score possible. Each game offers new opportunities to refine your dropping strategy, anticipate reactions, and pull off incredible combos. Can you outsmart the physics and become the ultimate Droppy Ball master?</p>",
